      "review_description": "Very rarely does a company come along that completely surpasses all expectations and in fact exceeds every other company I've dealt with in a long time. DMG is that company.Darren was prompt to come to my house and provide all the information I needed on products, and explain them in a way that was easy to understand. He didn't use complicated jargon or a hard sales pitch. He believes in the products he sells, and that makes it easy to have confidence that it's a worthwhile product.The entire process from initial meeting, to quote, to installation was hassle free. The lovely Christine organised installation and payments, and the team who did my installation was super professional. Darren finished up by giving me a rundown on how my solar system worked, and ensuring I was completely happy with my product.I cannot recommend this company highly enough. If you're trying to decide which company to choose, give DMG a go. You won't regret it.",
