      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I would like to thank you for referring me to Darren Magennis of DMG Solar Technology.As recommended, I did get two additional quotes. One was very much higher and one only slightly more than DMG. Partly because of your recommendation, I decided to accept the quote from DMG.It proved to be a very good choice. The friendly, efficient service was beyond reproach. All of the work was finished within half a day, with the 20 panels all fitted on the northern side of the house and not some on the western side as was being suggested by the other two companies. DMG arranged all the official approvals and documentation with the power supplier.The site was left clean and the placement of the inverter very aesthetically finished off, a very tidy job. Like you, Darren most assuredly recommended against even contemplating batteries at this stage.Kind regards,Mike Ashe, Carine, WA.",
